s for some good ol' fashion doujin originals and arrangements.</span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(179,179,179);font-family:Ubuntu, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>Track list:</strong><br /></p><ul style=\"color:rgb(179,179,179);font-family:Ubuntu, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><li>0:00:06 <span style=\"color:rgb(214,79,30);\"><strong>Tetrafreaks</strong> (Tetraforce)</span></li><li>0:04:05 <span style=\"color:rgb(255,204,153);\"><strong>Vapor Trail</strong> (Vapor Trail) - <em>GAMADELIC</em></span></li><li>0:08:01 <span style=\"color:rgb(214,79,30);\"><strong>Minor-1 </strong>(Legend of Noten)</span></li><li>0:15:29 <span style=\"color:rgb(255,204,153);\"><strong>BGM-E</strong> (Atomic Robokid) - <em>Mecano Associates</em></span></li><li>0:18:13 <span style=\"color:rgb(255,204,153);\"><strong>Wagiagare! Power</strong> (Midnight Resistance) - <em>GAMADELIC</em></span></li><li>0:21:09 <span style=\"color:rgb(255,204,153);\"><b>Running Up! (Bass enhanced version) </b>(Dirt Fox) - <em>Shinji Hosoe</em></span></li><li>0:27:19 <span style=\"color:rgb(255,204,153);\"><strong>Flash Flash Flash</strong> (Bosconian X86) - <em>Yuzo Koshiro</em></span></li><li>0:31:48 <span style=\"color:rgb(255,204,153);\"><strong>Activation</strong> (Martial Age X86) - <em>KIYO</em></span></li><li>0:35:59 <span style=\"color:rgb(214,79,30);\"><strong>Lost of Consciousness</strong> (Nouten Chokugeki III)</span></li><li>0:40:08 <span style=\"color:rgb(214,79,30);\"><strong>Exert all your Powers!!~</strong> (Super Sonic Shooter)</span></li><li></li></ul>","language":"eng","licenseurl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/3.0/","scanner":"Internet Archive HTML5 Uploader 1.6.3","subject":["VGM","game music","video game music","chip tunes","games","BGM","video game music podcast","retro gaming","retro games","game audio","PC-8801","PC-88","Firecracker","CHEMOOL","Music Disk"],"title":"Pixelated Audi